msgctxt "#32171"
msgid "Found {0} stuck episode(s) across {1} show(s):\n\n{2}"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32172"
msgid "Fixes two things that can leave a show stuck missing episodes no matter how many times you rescan: stuck episode entries left behind after removing a show, and shows whose season folder Kodi can no longer find (e.g. it was renamed on disk).\n\nPreview checks for both and shows you what it found -- nothing is changed. Repair Stuck Episodes fixes what Preview finds, but only after you confirm, and only after a safety backup of your Kodi library is made. Undo Last Repair reverses the single most recent repair, from that backup, if anything looks wrong afterward."
msgstr ""

